cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the curated phage-capsule table, please cite both the archived release and the paper."
title: "PhageMatch-PK: capsule-type phage coverage analysis for Klebsiella pneumoniae"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study of published bacteriophage coverage across the
  capsule (K) types of Pakistani clinical Klebsiella pneumoniae, including a
  curated phage-capsule evidence table and a BioProject-collapsed sensitivity
  analysis of geographic capsule-type differences.
type: software
license: MIT
